Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.86,0:00:11.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.78,0:00:13.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Kosaku Kawajiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.88,0:00:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I apologize for the\Ninconvenience but I'll be
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.64,0:00:18.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,arriving at the office\Nabout 15 minutes late.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.88,0:00:21.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My son is misbehaving and I must educate
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.84,0:00:24.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,him on the finer points\Nof familiar respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.38,0:00:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.84,0:00:29.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The matter is inconsequential from\Nthe perspective of a business owner.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.42,0:00:30.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.33,0:00:31.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My deepest apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.24,0:00:33.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.40,0:00:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.70,0:00:36.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll handle my son straight away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.90,0:00:39.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once that's done, I'll head to the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.82,0:00:40.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.73,0:00:41.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.65,0:00:43.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your understanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.46,0:00:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn Kosaku Kawajiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.46,0:00:51.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What an obsequious little drip.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.46,0:00:53.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were just a socially anxious nitwit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.78,0:00:56.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would you want to\Nclimb the corporate ladder?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.24,0:01:01.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke thinks he's so clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.30,0:01:04.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's clear that he only hid\Ninside that house because he
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.02,0:01:08.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thinks he'll have the advantage\Nin a close combat battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.04,0:01:12.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Admittedly, there's a kernel\Nof truth in that belief.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.28,0:01:14.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I want to survive this skirmish,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.38,0:01:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd be wise to avoid shining\Ndiamond like the plague.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.44,0:01:19.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can pinpoint Josuke's location,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.06,0:01:23.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can launch an air bullet from\Nhere and possibly make contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.94,0:01:24.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.98,0:01:27.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you! Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.80,0:01:30.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is private property.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.48,0:01:32.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you creeping around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.60,0:01:36.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.40,0:01:38.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You trying to say you ain't trespassing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.68,0:01:41.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, then I have some\Nquestions for you, smartass.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.18,0:01:43.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this your house?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.82,0:01:45.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How long have you been watching?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.30,0:01:46.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.42,0:01:48.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm asking the questions around here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.36,0:01:50.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I happen to live next door!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.18,0:01:54.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was taking a nap, but someone started\Nmaking a damn commotion and woke me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.70,0:01:56.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got my eye on you, creeper!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.08,0:02:00.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lovely Ryo lives here, and she said\Nsomeone keeps stealing her underwear!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.02,0:02:03.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it just so happens\Nno one's home now, perv!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.98,0:02:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.72,0:02:06.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.66,0:02:08.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Having all that free time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.42,0:02:09.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're walking away!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.28,0:02:11.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.64,0:02:13.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you prey on sweet Ryo like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.06,0:02:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a smarmy dick!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.50,0:02:24.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That perverted panty plunderer is sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.58,0:02:26.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These silky skivvies must
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.58,0:02:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They must be real?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.72,0:02:46.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.30,0:02:50.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such pure, pristine panties!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.76,0:02:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my lucky day!
