Dialogue: 1,0:04:17.94,0:04:23.65,Title Part 4,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(648,513)\pos(135,890)\fs60}Episode 38: {\fs80} Crazy Diamond is Unbreakable, Part 2
Dialogue: 1,0:04:17.94,0:04:23.65,Title Part 4,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(648,513)\pos(135,890)\fs60}Episode 38: {\fs80} Crazy Diamond is Unbreakable Part 2
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.18,0:04:27.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap! It's no use!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.88,0:04:29.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The phone line's been cut!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.64,0:04:40.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okoyasu's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.12,0:04:44.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which leaves me no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.16,0:04:49.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to use Shining Diamond to\Nwipe Yoshikage Kira off the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.48,0:04:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's plagued us long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.48,0:04:53.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm putting an end to this evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.56,0:04:55.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hayato.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.66,0:04:57.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hide against the wall till this is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.78,0:04:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want Kira laying eyes on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.72,0:05:09.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now which way?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.82,0:05:13.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which direction is he gonna attack from?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.16,0:05:41.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.62,0:05:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.38,0:05:47.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an air bullet and it's\Nmoving right towards you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.78,0:05:48.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.86,0:05:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's about the same size\Nas the one from before!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.32,0:05:52.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.24,0:05:56.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How in the world was he able to track\Nyou down from all the way out there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.50,0:05:58.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This doesn't make any sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.86,0:06:06.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Freaking great I see you\NJosuke Higashikata I know
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.16,0:06:10.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the exact distance between\Nus three meters until impact
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.48,0:06:17.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.36,0:06:19.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the culprit
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.27,0:06:20.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and if I can see it now
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.40,0:06:24.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that means Josuke can too\NYes now you can Dodge it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.54,0:06:28.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter how many of those he\Nshoots, you can get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.06,0:06:32.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.48,0:06:35.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, is it able to trace Josuke?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.42,0:06:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That hand-hoardin' killer's found\Na way to track my movements.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.82,0:06:47.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.86,0:06:49.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can he see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.68,0:06:53.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey that room doesn't have any windows and
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.82,0:06:55.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,where there are windows\Nthe curtains are drawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.44,0:06:58.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way he could have seen\Nyou from outside it must be automated
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.94,0:07:04.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's following You on autopilot no i\Ndon't think so deadly queen already
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.38,0:07:07.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,has a homing device it's an Annoying\Nlittle heat seeker called heart
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.98,0:07:13.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,attack just look this bullet is\Ncompletely ignoring the Lit cigarettes i
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.12,0:07:15.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't know all the details but i'm\Nwilling to bet if it was a homing
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.68,0:07:19.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,device The air bullet couldn't\Npenetrate the wall and think about it if
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.92,0:07:23.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this thing Really was automated Kira\Nwouldn't always need to hit the kill
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.22,0:07:27.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,switch Himself ship bricks how the\Nhell does he know exactly where i am
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.78,0:07:33.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to find Kira figure out\Nhow the hell he's watching me
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.60,0:07:41.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's right outside the gate two more
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.74,0:07:46.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,meters to go and then kaboom\Nare you? Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.58,0:07:50.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Chosuke, I don't get how he's\Ntracking you from all the way out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.88,0:07:51.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Start running!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.10,0:07:56.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastard, being a creepy\Nvoyeur is freaky enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.42,0:07:57.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One meter to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.10,0:08:01.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you've crossed into being a\Nstalker tracking my every move,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.44,0:08:03.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and that's just a bridge too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.86,0:08:04.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shining Diamond!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.62,0:08:07.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Contact is imminent.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.38,0:08:10.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Detonate!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.20,0:08:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I finally managed to get a clean hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.26,0:08:19.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deadly queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.48,0:08:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, I narrowly escaped death!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.06,0:08:25.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But luckily I was prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.94,0:08:27.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a true warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.56,0:08:29.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you'll fight the good\Nfight to the bitter end!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.02,0:08:33.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know better than to get close to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.38,0:08:35.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke Higashikata.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.50,0:08:37.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.94,0:08:40.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.85,0:08:41.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.60,0:08:45.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A direct hit, yet he remains fully intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.88,0:08:48.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a slight lag when I\Nmanually detonate the bomb,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.06,0:08:51.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but its potential to cause\Ndamage is unparalleled.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.94,0:08:54.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My next attack is going to seal the deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.74,0:08:57.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.68,0:08:59.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need you to get up now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.46,0:09:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to find somewhere safe to hide!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.58,0:09:04.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going the wrong direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.80,0:09:07.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to go back. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.48,0:09:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going the wrong way! Turn back!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.44,0:09:13.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to bash his brains in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.88,0:09:16.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring me to that bastard Yoshikage Kira!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.80,0:09:19.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My shining diamond can heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.38,0:09:22.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But its power won't work on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.00,0:09:26.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That said, all the blood I lost\Nearlier has dried and hardened.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.92,0:09:28.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's matter like any other.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.70,0:09:30.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just not a part of me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.54,0:09:34.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can grab a whole bunch of it\Nand stick it to whatever I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.84,0:09:38.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, I trapped some\Ninside a chunk of glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.96,0:09:43.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rain stopped, so that blood stain on\Nhis jacket should be good and dry by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.66,0:09:46.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behold my wondrous creation!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.52,0:09:50.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my own homemade homing missile.
