Dialogue: 3,0:09:59.95,0:10:00.99,Eyecatch - Left,signtop,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.6\pos(130,372.2)\shad2\4a&HFF&}Higashikata Josuke
Dialogue: 1,0:09:59.95,0:10:00.99,Eyecatch - Left,signtop,0,0,0,,{\pos(130,372.2)}Higashikata Josuke
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.20,0:10:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.62,0:10:09.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was the piece of glass\NI flicked away earlier!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.56,0:10:11.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The blood on my jacket!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.34,0:10:17.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The damn glass was pulled to the blood,\Nturning it into a jacket bullet! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.42,0:10:18.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got him good!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.74,0:10:21.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The projectile launched\Nitself right in his back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.26,0:10:29.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.48,0:10:33.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His shining diamond is really\Nstarting to irritate me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.48,0:10:36.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That damn stand is\Ncompletely unpredictable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.46,0:10:40.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even so, after my attack, Jousuke's\Nin much worse shape than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.82,0:10:46.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One more shot, just one more shot, and\NYoshikage Kira will bask in victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.10,0:10:53.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jousuke, it's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.88,0:10:56.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, I've never seen\Nhim make one this big!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.78,0:10:58.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess he's not messing around.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.88,0:11:01.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This has got to be his last-ditch attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.66,0:11:03.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, two can play at that game.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.40,0:11:04.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.68,0:11:06.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.88,0:11:09.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The same attack isn't going\Nto work on Kira twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.14,0:11:09.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.05,0:11:11.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll deflect it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.20,0:11:12.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe he will. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.74,0:11:15.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we'll never know until we try, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.46,0:11:16.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, Hayato,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.80,0:11:21.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to bother you, but I put that\Nlighter I was using back in my pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.44,0:11:22.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grab it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.30,0:11:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd do it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.82,0:11:28.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this piece of wood stuck in my\Nside is kind of getting in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.74,0:11:30.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't need to make smoke anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.38,0:11:32.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or you can already see\Nthe air bullet, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.66,0:11:33.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got it all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.04,0:11:36.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not using the lighter\Nto see the bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.76,0:11:38.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's for something else entirely.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.34,0:11:40.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trust me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.32,0:11:45.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time's come.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.48,0:11:48.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to find out how\Nhe knows where I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.84,0:11:50.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay very still, Hayato.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.12,0:11:54.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Josuke, what the heck are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.28,0:11:55.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it right there, Hayato.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.78,0:12:00.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to get the feeling and\Nhe's not observing us with his eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.50,0:12:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He may be listening to our every move.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.98,0:12:05.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kira was clutching a cell phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.48,0:12:07.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Simple coincidence?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.14,0:12:09.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.50,0:12:11.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So who was on the other end of that call?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.88,0:12:13.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His boss from the office?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.80,0:12:14.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.74,0:12:19.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's only one person in the world\NKira would call at a time like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.88,0:12:32.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd almost forgotten about you\Nfloating around, you crusty old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.88,0:12:36.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoshikage Kira's one and only\Nsavior, his pathetic father.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.52,0:12:41.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, I had no idea he'd\Nsnuck his way into my pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.34,0:12:42.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.66,0:12:44.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we have our answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.48,0:12:47.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.62,0:12:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the air bullet!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.62,0:12:50.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It passed right through the window!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.34,0:12:51.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.46,0:12:56.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It connected!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.20,0:12:58.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see Josuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.70,0:13:01.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's currently fleeing\Nthree meters forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.02,0:13:06.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.72,0:13:08.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It completely bypassed him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.34,0:13:10.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.28,0:13:12.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now the fool's moving to the right and up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.70,0:13:13.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.68,0:13:19.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He hasn't figured out it's Josuke\Npretending to be his father!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.12,0:13:23.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Change of plans. To the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.58,0:13:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move one meter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.08,0:13:26.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.20,0:13:27.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.46,0:13:29.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are such a duplicitous dickhead!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.72,0:13:31.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bullseye.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.64,0:13:32.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Press the button.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.68,0:13:35.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,GUSHIKANI!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.76,0:13:49.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, did that vaporize\NJosuke? Is he dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.96,0:13:52.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you splattered the room with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.90,0:13:55.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, he's floating in the great beyond.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.74,0:13:57.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he was already a ghost,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.34,0:14:01.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so it's more like you shipped him off\Nto the big nursing home in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.46,0:14:02.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.26,0:14:08.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.06,0:14:11.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.80,0:14:15.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This has to be some kind of mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.06,0:14:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could this be happening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.62,0:14:25.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was supposed to live a peaceful, quiet\Nlife, like a flower in a tranquil field.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.44,0:14:29.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suffering like this was\Nnever part of the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.46,0:14:31.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Yoshikage Kira, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.94,0:14:34.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't lose heart now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.16,0:14:37.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever happens, I must keep a cool head.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.98,0:14:41.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's trying times like these\Nthat truly test your mettle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.50,0:14:43.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it seems like\Nthings can't get any worse,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.98,0:14:47.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it'll all work out\Njust like every other time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.66,0:14:50.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though life has me\Nbacked into a corner,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.38,0:14:53.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my wits will turn this bout\Nof adversity into opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.26,0:14:56.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is what Yoshikage Kira does.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.76,0:14:58.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's what he excels at.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.62,0:15:01.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is my world, my reality,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.12,0:15:05.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and there's nothing in my world\Nthat I can't find a way to surmount!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.46,0:15:17.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You stepped into my range.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.70,0:15:21.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big mistake, Yoshikage Kira.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.46,0:15:31.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.46,0:15:35.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He took the bait and Josuke was able\Nto close the distance between them!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.30,0:15:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that it's close-quarter combat,\Nthis will be over in no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.04,0:15:43.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke definitely has the upper hand,\Nbut if Kira so much as grazes him,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.70,0:15:45.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he'll turn him into a human bomb!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.82,0:15:47.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if that wasn't bad enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.58,0:15:51.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that explosion from earlier really\Ndamaged Josuke's leg inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.00,0:15:54.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He shouldn't even be\Nable to stand right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.72,0:15:56.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.84,0:15:57.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.06,0:15:59.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm ending you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.78,0:16:01.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then bring it on. I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.64,0:16:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, call out, deadly queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.04,0:16:23.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deadly queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.12,0:16:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Buddha!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.56,0:16:40.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.47,0:16:41.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's dropped!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.44,0:16:43.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.18,0:16:46.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This brat is actually going to kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.40,0:16:52.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.02,0:16:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.18,0:16:55.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When did he do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.72,0:16:57.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was so close to winning!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.50,0:16:59.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chosuke was totally overpowering Kira!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.92,0:17:01.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, was he right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.56,0:17:04.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could luck really be on\Nthat murderer's side?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.68,0:17:10.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What all that punching\Nand I didn't connect
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.12,0:17:13.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they were blocked by the air bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.82,0:17:19.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how I never intended to use them as\Nprotection I didn't have time to act.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.20,0:17:26.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stray cat I understand stray\Ncat anticipated the incoming
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.68,0:17:29.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,flurry of blows and then\Nprotected itself instinctively.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.92,0:17:36.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time I have to make this work once\Nagain adversity invites opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.94,0:17:41.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's finish them off deadly\Nqueen make that air bullet a bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.30,0:17:48.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Victory it's now an explosive and at this\Ndistance your death is all but assured.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.72,0:17:52.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With the injuries you've got you don't\Nhave the ability to avoid my attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.00,0:17:55.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the end for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.10,0:17:58.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you, Kira!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.22,0:18:02.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A contact explosive?! Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.50,0:18:05.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quick, you have to grab a\Npiece of glass or wood to use!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.26,0:18:06.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whack it and take cover!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.40,0:18:09.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I win!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.54,0:18:14.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've come out on top just like every other\Ntime my back has been against the wall!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.28,0:18:17.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My guardian angel never fails,\Nyour fate has been sailed, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.60,0:18:19.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGH!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.02,0:18:25.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.72,0:18:27.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check out the air bullet!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.82,0:18:29.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For some reason it's changed course!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.90,0:18:33.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.44,0:18:35.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.86,0:18:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this really happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.02,0:18:40.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okuyasu! You're alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.58,0:18:43.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, this power!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.42,0:18:44.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It always blows my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.06,0:18:47.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've thought about it really hard,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.08,0:18:51.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I still can't figure out where the\Nhand puts all the stuff it scrapes away?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.22,0:18:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although I've never been\Nthe best at using my brain,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.08,0:18:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I guess that's no big surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.20,0:18:57.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Off you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.42,0:18:58.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How the hell did you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.94,0:19:00.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Okuyasu!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.82,0:19:02.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's as good as new!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.82,0:19:07.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm positive his heart stopped\Nbeating and he for sure wasn't breathing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.18,0:19:10.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh man, that dream was freaky as hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.62,0:19:17.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was walking around in this dark open\Nspace when I suddenly saw this bright light.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.94,0:19:28.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The source of that light was\Nmy brother, Big Bro Keicho.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.68,0:19:32.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He asked me where I was\Nplanning to go next.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.36,0:19:36.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told him, I'm going with you, Big Bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.70,0:19:40.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even as snot-nosed brats,\NI could count on my bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.92,0:19:45.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He made the best decisions, so I\Nalways knew I was in good hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.84,0:19:48.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then he said something I never expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.66,0:19:50.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.20,0:19:55.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okuyasu, wherever you go, you are\Nthe master of your own journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.74,0:19:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought about that real hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.80,0:20:05.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And as soon as I said I was going back\Nto Mariah, I woke up in the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.82,0:20:08.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had all sorts of sad feelings, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.18,0:20:11.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okuyasu.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.22,0:20:13.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, newsflash, Einstein.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.40,0:20:17.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This ain't the time to drone on\Nabout your bro and see in the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.58,0:20:20.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, seems like\Nsomeone's in a shitty mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.36,0:20:25.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those injuries must not be too bad, since\Nyou still have enough energy to be a dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.52,0:20:26.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut your face!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.98,0:20:30.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you were alive all along, why\Ndidn't you open your eyes, dumbass?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.94,0:20:32.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.46,0:20:37.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ever since I was a little child,\Nluck has always been on my side!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.86,0:20:40.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never run out of luck\Nand I refuse to start now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.18,0:20:44.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire another bomb, stray\Ncannon, make it count!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.96,0:20:52.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.87,0:20:54.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, there little dude, easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.28,0:20:56.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.40,0:20:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got Kira now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.88,0:21:01.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, he won't be able to\Nuse his air bullets as explosives!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.02,0:21:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It makes no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.78,0:21:06.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How has it come to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.82,0:21:10.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.73,0:21:13.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoshikage Kira's never met a\Nproblem he couldn't conquer!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.50,0:21:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't do me in! Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.46,0:21:16.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojaro, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.32,0:21:20.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like the bang came\Nfrom that house way over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.30,0:21:23.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sounded like some kind\Nof big gas explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.98,0:21:25.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, that man needs help!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.04,0:21:27.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just look, he's been injured!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.52,0:21:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.80,0:21:45.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Josuke and Okuyasu!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.34,0:21:48.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That kid they're with,\Nit's Hayato Kawajiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.48,0:21:51.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the man bleeding\Nout is Kosaku Kawajiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.64,0:21:54.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The puzzle pieces are falling into place.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.32,0:22:00.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter if you\Nhave some guardian angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.22,0:22:03.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your lucky break is about\Nto come to a painful end!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.46,0:22:07.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing you've got compares to\Nthese guys' righteous hearts!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.28,0:22:08.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're gonna make you pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.86,0:22:11.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you feel it, Yoshikage Kira?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.10,0:22:14.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The truth is staring\Nyou right in the face!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.68,0:22:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're nothing compared to them!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.93,0:22:52.30,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Any time I need to see your face, I just close my eyes
Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.30,0:22:54.56,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And I am taken to a place where your crystal mind
Dialogue: 1,0:22:54.56,0:22:57.35,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And magenta feelings take up shelter in the base of my spine
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.35,0:22:59.02,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Sweet like a chic-a-cherry cola
Dialogue: 1,0:22:59.02,0:23:01.40,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I don't need to try to explain, I just hold on tight
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.02,0:23:02.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if it happens again,
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.40,0:23:03.77,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And if it happens again, I might move so slightly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.80,0:23:04.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to move so slightly\Nto the arms and the lips
Dialogue: 1,0:23:03.77,0:23:06.57,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}To the arms and the lips and the face of the human cannonball
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.06,0:23:07.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the face of the humic\Nand the ball that I need to,
Dialogue: 1,0:23:06.57,0:23:08.28,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}That I need to, I want to
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.60,0:23:10.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to come and stand\Na little bit closer,
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.28,0:23:10.53,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Come stand a little bit closer
Dialogue: 1,0:23:10.53,0:23:12.87,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Breathe in and get a bit higher
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.80,0:23:12.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,breathe in and get a bit higher.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:12.87,0:23:14.49,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}You'll never know what hit you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.12,0:23:16.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll never know what\Nhit you when I get to you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:14.49,0:23:17.12,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}When I get to you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.06,0:23:22.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I want you, I don't\Nknow if I need you, but ooh,
Dialogue: 1,0:23:17.12,0:23:21.62,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I want you, I don't know if I need you, but...
Dialogue: 1,0:23:21.62,0:23:25.17,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I'd die to find out
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.44,0:23:24.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to find out.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:26.17,0:23:30.63,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I want you, I don't know if I need you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.48,0:23:33.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I want you, I don't know if I need\Nyou, but ooh, I've got to find out.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:30.63,0:23:34.01,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I would die to find out
